{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmz2VQjCBFEYdwSBdcV4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I decided:** Not really anything. I'd put the money in a \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" track, probably at Meitav, Harel or Menora, because they're names I know. I haven't opened anything today and I'm not sure. What tipped me to S&P is that it's the thing my friends talk about. For every company it's around 13–14% \"3 שנים\", and the fees are all about half a percent.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- The heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" was already picked.\n- The chips: I saw \"עוקב מדד s&p 500 12\" but didn't tap it. I just scrolled.\n- Harel first. Its \"עוקב מדד s&p 500\" had \"0.56%\" and \"13.7% 3 שנים\". That 13.7% stuck as my yardstick.\n- Then Mor at 0.71%, Analyst at 0.56%, Meitav at 0.6% with 13.87%, and Altshuler at 0.54%, where it said \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a number.\n- Then Phoenix, Migdal and Clal, then Menora at \"0.52%\" with 13.79%. By that point it was the same row over and over.\n- I thumbed fast through the rest: Infinity, and then a whole company, \"אילון\", where everything said \"חדש\" and \"עוד לא דווח\". Never heard of them, so I skipped it.\n\n**What I skipped:** The intro paragraph and the small print at the very bottom. \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\". The \"חוקים וכללים\" button. The \"ההפקדה\" fee line. Most of the bond and \"הלכה\" tracks.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"מט\"ח\", \"ההחיסכון\" vs \"ההפקדה\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתי סחיר\", \"גמיש\", \"משולב סחיר\".\n\n**What threw me:**\n- The little rings. \"מניות 99%\" and \"מט\"ח 99%\" make 198%. Sometimes it's \"101%\". I gave up on them. I guessed teal is shares and yellow is מט\"ח.\n- Every row repeats \"ההחיסכון / ההפקדה\" and \"3 שנים / 5 שנים\" and \"מניות / מט\"ח\". I had to read the whole thing again on every row just to find the one number that's different.\n- Fees only as percents. 0.52% versus 0.71% feels like nothing. Nowhere does it say what that is in shekels on my 30,000.\n- The orange banner at the top, \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\". It looks like a warning and made me trust the numbers less.\n- Lots of \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" and \"עוד לא דווח\" with orange \"!\" icons. They scared me off those rows.\n- It's a huge table and doesn't say which one is good. Somewhere in the middle of screen 4 or 5 I'd have quit on the bus."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4821,"cache_read_input_tokens":25583,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4821},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83bdb22e-989b-46b0-9ce7-33d5aacf71ff","uuid":"07ef0cbe-49cc-467c-a100-8990bc322602","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:24:07.086Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmz2V7rqSDqe7E2wdVD4"}
